// Test: Arithmetic operation - subtraction
// Spec: 03-TYPES.md § 3.4 Arithmetic Operations
// Priority: P0
//
// Purpose:
// Validates that integer subtraction works correctly.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should compile and print 10 (52 - 42)

rite main() {
    ≔ x: !i32 = 52;
    ≔ y: !i32 = 42;
    ≔ z: !i32 = x - y;
    println(z);
}
